cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file.
type: software
title: "Rainfall Erosivity Monitor (REM)"
abstract: >-
  Streamlit web application for monitoring rainfall erosivity and soil erosion risk.
  It uses precipitation data from GeoSphere Austria weather stations (TAWES, INCA) to
  calculate the EI30 erosivity index following USLE/RUSLE2, detects erosive storm events,
  issues colour-coded alerts and recommends field surveys after erosive events.
authors:
